---
import StudioLayout from '../../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
---

<StudioLayout
  title="Admin help"
  description="Private guide to Studio Admin."
  heading="Admin help"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 py-5 md:py-8">
    <p class="text-sm">
      <a href="/studio/help" class="text-gel underline-offset-2 hover:text-gold hover:underline">
        ← All help
      </a>
      {' · '}
      <a href="/studio/admin" class="text-gel underline-offset-2 hover:text-gold hover:underline">
        Open Admin
      </a>
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-muted">
      Admin is for studio-wide settings — not day-to-day publishing or student records.
    </p>

    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm text-muted">
      <li>
        <span class="text-spotlight">Access</span> (live) — who can sign in, publish, and use People.
        Open{' '}
        <a href="/studio/help/access" class="text-gel hover:text-gold">Access help</a>
        {' '}or{' '}
        <a href="/studio/admin/access" class="text-gel hover:text-gold">Access</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="text-spotlight">Calendar</span> (live connect) — connect the Studio organizer
        Google account and optional Elyse free/busy under{' '}
        <a href="/studio/admin/calendar" class="text-gel hover:text-gold">Admin → Calendar</a>.
        Per-student lessons live under Students → Schedules. Studio-wide holidays and vacations are
        not built yet. See{' '}
        <a href="/studio/help/calendar" class="text-gel hover:text-gold">Calendar help</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="text-spotlight">Reports</span> (not built) — studio-wide reporting.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</StudioLayout>
